** PROGRAM  : RCHKUL
** FUNCTION : CHECK IF THE PASSED PARAMETER IS A DEFINED USER ID OR LIST
** AUTHOR   : MICHEL
*
* Maintenance
* xsetggr 2003-08-20 p(240465) not allowed userd 'DEFAULT'
* --------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
1 #PARM(A08)
1 #EXIST(L)
LOCAL USING VUSERS-L
LOCAL
1 LISTS  VIEW OF NRM-DISTRIBUTION-LIST
  2 D-LIST-NAME
END-DEFINE
RESET #EXIST
*  --- CHECK IF USER ---
FIND-USER.
* FIND NUMBER USERS WITH USER-ID = #PARM
* IF *NUMBER(FIND-USER.) > 0 MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
* xsetggr 2003-08-20 p(240465) 2 lines above out next 3 lines in
FIND (1) USERS WITH USER-ID = #PARM WHERE USER-ID NE 'DEFAULT'
  IF *NUMBER(FIND-USER.) > 0
    MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
END-FIND                          /* xsetggr 2003-08-20 p(240465) in
*  --- CHECK IF LIST ---
FIND-LIST.
FIND NUMBER LISTS WITH D-LIST-NAME = #PARM
IF *NUMBER(FIND-LIST.) > 0 MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
END
